tes":"I thought this tree was E viminalis, but it isn't. Not sure what eucalypt it is. There are viminalis next to it, but have never seen a koala in one of them."}],["1655966594",138.83807,-34.92524,15715,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-01-10",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"0fde009f-d475-4089-893c-c254f772b930","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:89078","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966594","behavior":"Climbing,Eating","notes":"Saw him just on dusk last evening. Had gone by morning. Think it was the smaller of our two regular visitors"}],["1655966606",138.83871,-34.92572,15731,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-01-26",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"6776949e-5d62-44f8-a23b-b6d6029ebb9e","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:89197","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966606","behavior":"Climbing","notes":"Kenneth' came back sometime today. Started off in his favourite eucalypt(unidentified as yet), then during the day moved to the E. cinerea. Hasn't been around since Jan 16th."}],["1655966617",138.83869,-34.9258,15720,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-01-15",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"789af417-633d-4920-8c1c-c9f58604dcdd","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:89097","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966617","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"This is the smaller koala who visits. Yesterday it was in a tree on the side of the road. Today it has moved to this tree that is often used by our larger boy 'Kenneth'. K has moved on overnight."}],["1655966665",138.83842,-34.92571,15719,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-01-14",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceI