ull,"2013-02-11",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"06a71854-1f24-4483-a1c5-f5d2ca81b899","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:89523","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966648","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Kenneth has moved to a different tree overnight. Moved again today to an adjacent tree."}],["1655966578",138.83873,-34.92585,15777,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-13",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"087fb70c-6204-41e8-8766-94a2d66b1fba","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:91727","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966578","notes":"Kenneth was very distressed and suffering from extreme heat. Low enough and tired anough that we could touch him. Gave him a bowl ow water. Checked two hours later and he had moved trees, but had obviously been in the water bowl. Very stressed still. Thought he might die. Checked again 2 hours later and he was much brighter. Looking around and had moved higher. ! hour later after more water he had gone."}],["1655966595",138.83867,-34.9258,15774,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-10",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"3b41e8cc-a1f6-4241-a8d2-166f3c74d0b0","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:91623","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966595","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Kenneth was about 2 metres above the ground. He is looking quite old and careworn. I suspect he needed water so we filled the bowl at the base of the tree."}],["1655966620",138.83806,-34.92586,15773,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-09",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"69beb376-1bac-4afa-8486-7caddc296bbd","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:91501","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966620","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"I think this is Kenneth from the size. Very hard to see his distinguishing features. We have only seen him in this tree once before. It is in the open on its own and is not a favoured tree."}],["1655966649",138.83821,-34.92519,15789,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-25",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"8b2c88b5-7b3e-4010-baed-e0a6190dfab0","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:92147","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966649","behavior":"Sleeping","notes":"This is Kenneth. The previous day he was on the other side of the garden and has moved across to the other side of the dam. He seems to have a pattern of movement. From here he goes next door to a patch of scrub."}],["1655966659",138.83925,-34.9006,15789,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-25",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"212d9c22-7651-4780-a31f-3f41078f3f8d","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:92148","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966659","behavior":"Sleeping","notes":"This is the first time I have seen a koala here. There is not a lot of vegetation along this road."}],["1655966661",138.83868,-34.92579,15778,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-14",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"d4d1a4e4-c44b-49f1-b4a9-433c125733a9","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:91765","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966661","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Kenneth again. Looking much brighter than 2 days ago when he was obviously heat stressed."}],["1655966664",138.83866,-34.92576,15782,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-03-18",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"e88d66bd-0f68-49f4-a568-2857ca0b9360","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:91845","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966664","behavior":"Climbing,Sitting","notes":"We knew he was here as the tray of the ute was full of koala poo. He came down the tree to the lowest branch while we were there."}],["1655966618",138.83822,-34.92521,15807,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-04-12",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"cc253beb-baff-4054-83e3-3a7e79c8b629","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:92514","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966618","behavior":"Sleeping","notes":"Kenneth has been here on and off for a week. Last seen 8.4.13"}],["1655966670",138.83845,-34.92573,15902,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-07-16",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"3e2bc6d9-43a3-46c6-bb2b-752d383575d7","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:95248","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966670","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Kenneth is back. We haven't seen him since May, although we have twice heard a koala calling. In fact we haven't seen any koalas in any of our usual spots since May."}],["1655964787",138.83821,-34.92524,15938,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-08-21",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"7cf339ca-aaf0-4fcf-b7cf-80bece02f19f","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:106837","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655964787","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Haven't had many sightings lately. was pleased to see that Kenneth has returned"}],["1655964842",138.83813,-34.92518,15992,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-10-14",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"25e6ed0d-959f-4c6d-b920-c26a4